# Guard against search tools walking multi-gigabyte binary artifacts.
# Added 2026-08-12 after a "grep -ril" over ~/dev buffered a 34G ROS bag
# into memory as a single line and livelocked the machine for 18 hours.
# All of these are large, binary and reproducible. Override with --no-ignore.

# ROS bags
*.bag
*.bag.*

# Model checkpoints and weights. The suffixed forms matter: *.pt alone
# does NOT match best.pt.dead-2026-08-02, which is 2.1G.
*.pt
*.pt.*
*.pth
*.pth.*
*.ckpt
*.ckpt.*
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.h5
*.npz

# Bulk datasets
*.tfrecord
*.parquet
*.arrow
